      "factId": "motorcycle-mirror-draft-001",
      "topicId": "motorcycle_mirror",
      "factText": "摩托车后视镜必须可调，装车后在正常使用中保持稳定，并让驾驶者能够在正常骑姿下调整镜面方向。",
      "sourceIds": ["src-eurlex-un-r81-motorcycle-mirrors", "src-eurlex-dir-97-24-motorcycle-mirrors"],
      "riskLevel": "safety",
      "reviewStatus": "draft"
    },
    {
      "factId": "motorcycle-mirror-draft-002",
      "topicId": "motorcycle_mirror",
      "factText": "UNECE R81 对摩托车后视镜设有最小反射面积和可容纳圆直径要求，镜面不能只靠外形好看而任意缩小。",
      "sourceIds": ["src-eurlex-un-r81-motorcycle-mirrors", "src-eurlex-dir-97-24-motorcycle-mirrors"],
      "riskLevel": "safety",
      "reviewStatus": "draft"
    },
    {
      "factId": "motorcycle-mirror-draft-003",
      "topicId": "motorcycle_mirror",
      "factText": "在 UNECE R81 规则下，设计时速超过 50 公里的两轮车需左右各装一面镜；较低时速车型至少装一面。",
      "sourceIds": ["src-eurlex-un-r81-motorcycle-mirrors", "src-eurlex-dir-97-24-motorcycle-mirrors"],
